ses and pay for services through Nu app. Additionally, it offers protection solutions, such as NuInsurance protection solutions, including life, mobile, auto, home, and financial protection insurance policies; and beyond financial services solutions, including NuTravel, a travel portal; and NuCel, a mobile phone service. Nu Holdings Ltd. was founded in 2013 and is based in Sao Paulo, Brazil.","employees":null,"website":"https://nubank.com.br","country":"Brazil","city":"Sao Paulo","officers":[{"name":"Mr. David  Velez-Osomo","title":"Founder, Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Roberto  de Oliveira Campos Neto","title":"Executive Vice-Chairman and Global Head of Public Policy"},{"name":"Mr. Rob  Livingston","title":"Chief Financial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.71,"tpe":12.49,"ps":3.468,"pfcf":11.56,"peg":1.32,"pb":1.592,"ev_ebitda":11.19,"rev_growth":0.088,"eps_growth":0.1125,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1351,"eps_growth_next":0.1037,"div_yield":0.0219,"roe":0.1287,"roa":0.01557,"de":54.09,"gross_margin":0.2344,"op_margin":0.3491,"profit_margin":0.2565,"current_ratio":1.523},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":12.05,"sector":10.71,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":16.43,"sector":12.49,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":6.968,"sector":3.468,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":11.56,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.41,"sector":1.32,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":4.425,"sector":1.592,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":null,"sector":54.09,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.344,"sector":0.088,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.401,"sector":0.1125,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.3764,"sector":0.1351,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth_next","label":"EPS growth (next year,